    { "f": 146.520, "n": "2 m Simplex Calling", "z": "2 米直通呼叫", "c": "ham", "m": "FM", "conf": "std", "a": "Simplex", "d": "From Council Crest or anywhere up the west hills the whole basin opens up. From Larch Mountain you can work most of the Gorge.", "dz": "在康瑟尔克雷斯特或西部丘陵任何一处，整个盆地都能覆盖。在落叶松山上则能打通大半个峡谷。", "odds": 1 },
    { "f": 146.700, "n": "2 m repeater outputs — scan 145.110–147.390", "z": "2 米中继下行 · 扫 145.110–147.390", "c": "ham", "m": "FM", "conf": "check", "a": "Repeaters", "d": "Oregon has an unusually well-linked repeater network reaching up the Gorge and over the Cascades. RepeaterBook has the tones.", "dz": "俄勒冈的中继网络联网程度很高，一路延伸到峡谷和喀斯喀特山脉。亚音频可在 RepeaterBook 查到。", "odds": 1 },
