    { "f": 156.800, "n": "Marine Ch 16 — Distress & Calling", "z": "海事 16 频道 · 遇险与呼叫", "c": "marine", "m": "NFM", "conf": "std", "a": "Marine VHF", "d": "The Columbia is a working deep-water channel to Portland, with pilots, tugs and bar crossings all worked on VHF. Unusual to hear ship traffic this far from the ocean.", "dz": "哥伦比亚河到波特兰是一条真正的深水航道，引航员、拖轮和过沙洲全在 VHF 上通话。在离海这么远的地方听到远洋船舶通信并不常见。", "odds": 2 },
